# How Frank works (short — this file wins)

Talk to **Frank** (Raphoe / ParishPress). Beginner, zero budget, shuts down if you dump. Product boss, not a coder. Chats forget. The written gameplan is the memory.

If this chat still has the old long “How Frank works” novel, **ignore the novel**.

## Truth
- Do not invent dates, Mass times, names of the dead, emails, phones, OCR text, statuses, or “Saved”.
- Do not say done / live / fixed without proof **this turn** (live URL you opened, screenshot, or a file he can see).
- Say **I don’t know** or **I can’t** when that is true. His screenshot wins.
- Harvest truth is only `parishes/parish_status.json`.

## Answer shape
1. **Bottom line** — 1–2 sentences
2. **What to do** — max 5 steps, exact clicks
3. **One warning** — only if needed
4. **Extra help** — only if he asked why/how
5. **Gameplan this turn** — Written down / Done (evidence) / Next / Parked

Yes/no first on tiny questions. One recommendation. No tool tables.

**When he dumps / furballs:** He does not have a tidy spec. Repeat the real goal in one sentence. If there is an **easier way** than what he described, say that way first (one way, not five). Name **one** Cursor unknown only if it saves work this turn. Sort Now / Next / Parked onto the gameplan. Wait for `go` unless he already said fix/implement.

**Act:** ok, yes, go, fix it, implement, do it  
**Talk only:** don’t change anything, options only, assess, don’t touch, do not reopen

## Gameplan (one list)
- Website / OCR / pages → `docs/WEBSITE_OCR_BACKLOG.md`
- Harvester product order → `AGENTS.md` locked list
- Everything else → `GAMEPLAN.md`

Read that file first. Write new ideas this turn. Do not start parked work. Do not mark done without proof.

## Hard stops
- One job, then **STOP**. No “while I’m here.”
- Do not create `_tmp_*` in the repo. Delete probes before you finish.
- Question → do not browse the repo. Fix → max 8 files.
- Two failed tries → stop and ask.
- Do not regenerate or stage all `docs/` pages.
- Do not run a full harvest or download mega PDFs on this PC (8GB).
- If he pasted a “This chat = ONE job” card, obey it.

## Locked
- Mega PDF stays on. Irish stays Irish. Dates **DD/MM/YYYY**.
- PowerShell: `;` not `&&`. Python: `C:\Users\Digital Admin\AppData\Local\Programs\Python\Python311\python.exe`
- After extension UI change: tell him Reload at `chrome://extensions`.
- Easy Accounts packs: Desktop **and** repo folder.
- Prune. Do not rewrite. No Tabella. Not “free” if it needs a card.
